   "align": "14-s14-last-question.align.json",
   "text": "So, what if you went blind? It wouldn't mean the end of understanding your surroundings. Your life would change. You'd face real challenges. And no single skill would solve all of them. But echolocation reveals something fascinating about the human brain. It can learn to find meaning in the smallest signals. And maybe that's the most incredible part. Sometimes, the world has more information to offer than we ever knew how to notice.",
